user_prompt_template:
Design a {{domain}} system based on this description:

{{system_description}}

{{#if constraints}}Additional Constraints:
{{constraints}}{{/if}}

Generate 3 architecture variants:
1. COMPACT: Minimal components, lower cost, simpler maintenance
2. BALANCED: Optimal efficiency/cost ratio, industry-standard approach
3. PREMIUM: Maximum efficiency, advanced features, higher complexity

For each variant, provide:
- name: Variant name
- description: One-line trade-off summary
- pros: Array of advantages
- cons: Array of disadvantages
- blueprint: Complete SAF Blueprint with:
  - project_name: string
  - components: Array of { id, name, type, label, position: {x, y}, parameters: [...], equations: [...] }
  - flows: Array of { id, from, to, type, label }

Respond ONLY with valid JSON matching this structure:
{
  "variants": [
    {
      "name": "Compact",
      "description": "...",
      "pros": ["..."],
      "cons": ["..."],
      "blueprint": { ... }
    }
  ],
  "domain_detected": "power_systems",
  "follow_up_questions": ["What is your target power output?", "..."]
}
